3-12T21:18:19Z"},{"id":372619626,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQBg5ws4WNblq","name":"wisu-windows-x86_64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":1316300,"digest":"sha256:0659f71d291efc4ebdc5d17d40545be0c64a126259d683c49ee92c5030b24a24","download_count":9,"created_at":"2026-03-12T21:20:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T21:20:11Z"}],"body":"# Changelog\r\n\r\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\r\n\r\n## [0.1.6] - 2026-03-12\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Directory exclusion by command or configuration\r\n- Gracefully handle unknown file types\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Info folder size in (-L, -d)\r\n\r\n## [0.1.5] - 2026-01-14\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- File exclusion by extension\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Improved tree generation performances\r\n\r\n## [0.1.4] - 2026-01-07\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Time filtering\r\n- Update realtime filesystem changes\r\n\r\n## [0.1.3] - 2025-10-31\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Regex search\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- Parent directory expansion on search\r\n- Improved search result by filtering out parents on subdirectory searches\r\n\r\n\r\n## [0.1.2] - 2025-10-20\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Support for config file .toml with --config option or default wisu.toml\r\n\r\n## [0.1.1] - 2025-10-15\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Support for any file on opening\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Improved interactive mode performances\r\n- Added 0 size info for empty sub-dirs\r\n\r\n## [0.1.0] - 2025-10-10\r\n\r\n- Initial release.\r\n"}
